WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.253 --> 00:00:04.963
The greatest video
game of the 80's

00:00:06.297 --> 00:00:08.717
is now the greatest
showdown on TV.

00:00:08.717 --> 00:00:10.677
This is Frogger!

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:15.140
$100,000 on the line.

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:16.558
You know the game.
Don't fall in.

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:17.308
Get to the other side.

00:00:17.308 --> 00:00:18.476
Ready!

00:00:23.148 --> 00:00:24.691
-Wow!
-Way to go!

00:00:27.777 --> 00:00:28.695
Nooo...

00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:30.280
Nooo...

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:32.115
No.

00:00:33.742 --> 00:00:34.743
Oh!

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:41.082
Are you froggin' kidding me?

00:00:46.087 --> 00:00:47.839
That's how you play Frogger!

